1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
Have you linked your email ID to Aadhaar?

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:06,950
If you haven't, link it
right now, using your phone,

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,900
for free.

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:15,150
Earlier, PAN card linking was free for us.

5
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:18,700
After that, now, PAN linking costs money.

6
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:21,880
In the same way, for this
too, after December 31

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,950
you'll have to pay.

8
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:27,100
So, to do it for free,
do it now, on your phone.

9
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,100
Let me tell you how.

10
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:32,690
For useful videos like this, subscribe,

11
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:36,500
share it with everyone, let
people know this can be done.

12
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,440
Anyway, let's get into it.

13
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,390
Welcome to V Create!

14
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,400
Welcome, everyone, to a new video.

15
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:45,720
For this, download the new mAadhaar app —

16
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,250
link in the description.

17
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:50,270
Download and open it,
enter your Aadhaar details

18
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,900
and log in to the app.

19
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:55,320
After that, you'll see this interface.

20
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:58,410
Here, at the very bottom: Services.

21
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,800
Select it.

22
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:03,050
Once you select it, you'll
see many options here.

23
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:06,700
Among them, Email Add
/ Update — that option.

24
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:10,150
It'll say Free there,
and how long it's free —

25
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:12,870
a date notice is given right here.

26
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,530
You'll see it.

27
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:14,400
Select it.

28
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:18,450
Once selected, here you'll
see Add / Link email address —

29
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:19,510
that option is there.

30
00:01:19,530 --> 00:01:23,300
Below it, "No email linked
to your Aadhaar" shows.

31
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:27,650
If it's already linked,
it shows here as linked.

32
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:31,200
So, to do this, it's very simple.

33
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:34,650
Continue to update email
address — tap this button.

34
00:01:34,670 --> 00:01:38,940
Once you tap it, the email you
want to add, type it in here.

35
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:42,250
After entering the email ID, tap Send OTP.

36
00:01:42,270 --> 00:01:43,350
Select it.

37
00:01:43,370 --> 00:01:47,200
After tapping Send OTP,
to the email you entered,

38
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:48,820
an OTP will arrive.

39
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,260
Type it in here.

40
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:53,270
Type it, Continue to review — tap it,

41
00:01:53,290 --> 00:01:55,910
and the email ID you gave shows up here.

42
00:01:55,930 --> 00:01:58,960
After that, Continue to
face authentication —

43
00:01:58,980 --> 00:02:01,310
if you get that option, select it.

44
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:04,500
If not, whatever other
option appears, select that.

45
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:08,690
After that, your photo
is captured like this.

46
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:11,800
Once it's captured, "Face
authenticated successfully"

47
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:13,560
will appear.

48
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:17,770
After that, Continue to submit
request — tap that button,

49
00:02:17,790 --> 00:02:20,260
and you're back here.

50
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:24,650
From there, again, Submit
request — tap it, and

51
00:02:24,670 --> 00:02:28,110
the request to update
your email gets sent.

52
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:31,860
Once the request is sent,
you'll get a message and

53
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:35,410
a notification, saying
it's been submitted.

54
00:02:35,430 --> 00:02:37,610
If you want the acknowledgement

55
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,960
receipt, download it from here.

56
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:43,350
So, very simply, with just your phone,

57
00:02:43,370 --> 00:02:44,950
add your email ID.

58
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:48,980
This video will help everyone — no doubt.

59
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,910
Share it with everyone, let people know

60
00:02:51,930 --> 00:02:54,360
they can do this themselves.

61
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:57,240
See you again with a new topic!

